= Phylogenetics — Simple =

Phylogenetics studies evolutionary relationships. Researchers often infer trees from DNA, protein, or other data, but the tree is a model with uncertainty—not a direct recording of history.

'''Important boundary:''' phylogenetic tree ≠ directly observed history.

